      "body": "## Purpose\r\n- Current integration pathway is causing gibberish as a result of this commit: 55d037e2e5\r\n- Fix post weight loading processing to properly handle params for FP8A16 marlin\r\n\r\n## Test Plan\r\n- Basic local smoke testing\r\n```python\r\n    from vllm import LLM, SamplingParams\r\n    import torch\r\n\r\n    prompts = [\r\n        \"The Swiss Alps are\",\r\n        \"Brad Marchand is\",\r\n        \"The Toronto Maple Leafs are\"\r\n    ]\r\n\r\n    # Create a sampling params object for greedy sampling\r\n    sampling_params = SamplingParams(temperature=0.80, top_p=0.95, max_tokens=40, min_tokens=10)\r\n    model = \"nm-testing/fp8_weight_only_tensor-e2e\"\r\n\r\n    llm = LLM(\r\n        model=model,\r\n        tensor_parallel_size=1\r\n    )\r\n    output = llm.generate(prompts, sampling_params)\r\n    for out in output:\r\n        print(out.outputs[0].text)\r\n```\r\n\r\nBefore:\r\n```bash\r\nISTerteschriftteck auteurswitzBoard fixesISTRLLENGTHanstaltERTzelhalbwitzédéwitzeszwitzконоwitzwitzwitzperpwitzegrwitzħvaäswitzatumwitziš portswitzwitz�witz\r\nídoISTţäsäs włISTäsISTlungwitzěníegründEGwitzrijäsovedesadernualeț lassenäsbbeualeäsarteaneISTwitz firäs mouse janaltungIIfahrenmandeEC\r\ndagDraw})$.eenwitzlungwitzконоktopwitzanstaltäswitzницeg fixedortenLENGTH Stawitzlogging którewitzħкономSIZEanstalt Schrift方 segmentsjquerycheréléesz� #### absent fot电тку\r\n```\r\n\r\nAfter:\r\n```\r\n a UNESCO World Heritage Site. The stunning mountain range is made up of glaciers, snow-capped peaks, and meandering rivers, making it an incredible destination\r\n putting his stamp on the Bruins with his play. Marchand has 10 points in his last 11 games, and he is poised to have a breakout year. The Bru\r\n poised to offer Auston Matthews a five-year contract extension after their 5-2 win over the Ottawa Senators, according to a report from the Globe and Mail.\r\n```\r\n",
